Brian,

What this message likely means, in your case, is that your #9 card was
not the original display device in your AXP150.  What you must do is
borrow an instance of your original display device - I would expect it
to have been a QVision, most likely.  Bring up Windows NT with this
original card installed, go into the control panel, bring up the Display
applet, and change your display device to #9.  Then restore your new #9
card and boot Windows NT, which should come up just fine.

Cheers,
