In-Reply-To: <01I27EFPJ7II0016JV@NSTCC.CC.TN.US>

Hello,
download axpmosaic from http://www.garply.com/tech/comp/sw/pc/nt/alpha.html
then read the readme and move the missing *.dll's where the readme instructs.
Now I have netscape, Mosaic, MS's Internet Explorer all running.  MS's IE 
