Does anyone remember comparing NT v3.1 vs. Novell client costs?  Microsoft
charged a nominal fee for the server license and the clients were FREE!!! 
 But
along comes version 3.5 and the client access now costs money plus you need
to have the client licenses on maintenance or pay to upgrade the client 
access
when you upgrade the server version.

When Microsoft says something is "Free!", you better keep your hand on your
wallet.  Once they gain a little market share, we won't be saying ahhhhhhhh.

Richard Wolff ---------------------------------------------- rrwolff@bpa.gov

