From: David Steadson <DavidS@gpo.pa.uq.edu.au>
Subject: RE: Routing Domain Logons

Assuming you are using TCP/IP, you will need to use LMHOSTS files on each   
of the clients.  There should be an example file, LMHOSTS.SAM in the   
\Windows\System directory which will give you appropriate directions. The   
#DOM option is the one of most interest to you.

