There are many, many reasons why I would consider it worthwhile to 
upgrade from NT 3.1 to NT 3.51; I will not list them all. I'm sure
there is plenty of marketing stuff available at MS's web site.

In my experience, the best improvements of 3.50/3.51 over 3.1 are
increased system stability and better utilization of system resources.
NT 3.50/3.51 have less stringent memory requirements than 3.1 did - 
12MB for Workstation, vs. 16MB for NT 3.1.

The networking and Internet support is much improved, also.

Brian

